    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p>Ion Mines can disable <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a> without causing lasting harm, allowing them to be captured or salvaged later on. An Ion Mine is placed in or on the ground (In any square adjacent to you) and is triggered when any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ground_Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ground Vehicle\">Ground Vehicle</a> enters the Mine's square. </p><p>An Ion Mine deals <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage to everything in a 2-square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. </p>",
